  the legacy 2014 Material asset (sharp top corners, hard V notch). The
  source viewBox is "0 -960 960 960" (y in [-960,0]), which Android's
  viewport can't express directly; the translateY(960) group shifts it
  into [0,960] instead of hand-transforming every path coordinate.
-->
